‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" bgcolor="#e8edef" class="sml-dark-14i9q8" style="width:100%;background-color:#e8edef"><tbody><tr><td class="sml-email sml-dark-1vgvcs2" style="color:#14232a;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px"><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="560" style="width:100%;max-width:560px"><tbody><tr><td class="px-1 pt-8 pb-5" style="padding-left:0.25rem;padding-right:0.25rem;padding-top:2rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tbody><tr><td width="30" height="30" align="center" class="bg-primary font-heading text-primary-foreground rounded-md text-[18px] leading-[30px] sml-dark-mmc4bl" style="border-radius:4px;background-color:#0d5a61;font-family:&quot;Iowan Old Style&quot;, &quot;Palatino Linotype&quot;, Palatino, &quot;Book Antiqua&quot;, Georgia, serif;font-size:18px;line-height:30px;color:#f1faf9">A</td><td class="font-heading text-foreground pl-3 text-[21px] leading-[30px] sml-dark-1vgvcs2" style="padding-left:0.75rem;font-family:&quot;Iowan Old Style&quot;, &quot;Palatino Linotype&quot;, Palatino, &quot;Book Antiqua&quot;, Georgia, serif;font-size:21px;line-height:30px;color:#14232a">Acme</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="560" style="width:100%;max-width:560px"><tbody><tr><td class="bg-card rounded-xl px-6 py-8 sm:px-10 sm:py-10 sml-dark-1kmbbjh" style="border-radius:10px;background-color:#ffffff;padding-left:1.5rem;padding-right:1.5rem;padding-top:2rem;padding-bottom:2rem"><div><h1 class="font-heading text-card-foreground m-0 text-[30px] leading-[38px] font-normal sml-dark-1vgvcs2" style="margin:0px;font-family:&quot;Iowan Old Style&quot;, &quot;Palatino Linotype&quot;, Palatino, &quot;Book Antiqua&quot;, Georgia, serif;font-size:30px;line-height:38px;font-weight:400;color:#14232a">Welcome, Maya</h1><p class="text-card-foreground mt-4 mb-0 text-[16px] leading-[26px] sml-dark-1vgvcs2" style="margin-top:1rem;margin-bottom:0px;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#14232a">Your workspace <strong>Northwind</strong> is set up and waiting. Everything you add from here on lives in one place your whole team can reach.</p></div><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td height="28" style="height:28px;line-height:28px;font-size:1px">​</td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse"><tbody><tr><td align="left"><!--[if mso]><v:roundrect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" href="https://app.example.com" style="height:46px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:215px;" arcsize="9%" stroke="false" fillcolor="#0d5a61"><w:anchorlock/><center style="color:#f1faf9;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;">Open your workspace</center></v:roundrect><![endif]--><a class="sml-button rounded-md sml-dark-mmc4bl" href="https://app.example.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="background-color:#0d5a61;color:#f1faf9;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;line-height:46px;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;padding:0 22px;mso-hide:all">Open your workspace</a></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td height="36" style="height:36px;line-height:36px;font-size:1px">​</td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="border-border border-t sml-dark-1uoilbz" style="border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:1px;border-color:#d3dde0"><tbody><tr><td width="36%" valign="top" class="border-border text-muted-foreground border-b py-3 pr-4 text-[14px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1ghdlaw" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#d3dde0;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;padding-right:1rem;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#52646b">Workspace</td><td valign="top" class="border-border text-card-foreground border-b py-3 text-[14px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1xwt0wx" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#d3dde0;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#14232a">Northwind</td></tr><tr><td width="36%" valign="top" class="border-border text-muted-foreground border-b py-3 pr-4 text-[14px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1ghdlaw" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#d3dde0;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;padding-right:1rem;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#52646b">Address</td><td valign="top" class="border-border text-card-foreground border-b py-3 text-[14px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1xwt0wx" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#d3dde0;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#14232a">northwind.example.app</td></tr><tr><td width="36%" valign="top" class="border-border text-muted-foreground border-b py-3 pr-4 text-[14px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1ghdlaw" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#d3dde0;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;padding-right:1rem;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#52646b">Plan</td><td valign="top" class="border-border text-card-foreground border-b py-3 text-[14px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1xwt0wx" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#d3dde0;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#14232a">Team trial</td></tr><tr><td width="36%" valign="top" class="border-border text-muted-foreground border-b py-3 pr-4 text-[14px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1ghdlaw" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#d3dde0;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;padding-right:1rem;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#52646b">Trial ends</td><td valign="top" class="border-border text-card-foreground border-b py-3 text-[14px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1xwt0wx" style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#d3dde0;padding-top:0.75rem;padding-bottom:0.75rem;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#14232a">November 2, 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td height="32" style="height:32px;line-height:32px;font-size:1px">​</td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td class="sml-stack pr-6 pb-6" valign="top" width="50%" style="padding-right:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem"><p class="font-heading text-card-foreground m-0 text-[18px] leading-[24px] sml-dark-1vgvcs2" style="margin:0px;font-family:&quot;Iowan Old Style&quot;, &quot;Palatino Linotype&quot;, Palatino, &quot;Book Antiqua&quot;, Georgia, serif;font-size:18px;line-height:24px;color:#14232a">Invite your team</p><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-2 mb-2 text-[14px] leading-[22px] sml-dark-1js7ka7" style="margin-top:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#52646b">A workspace works best with everyone in it. Add people by email and choose what each of them can change.</p><a class="sml-link text-[14px] font-semibold sml-dark-13arv6u" href="https://app.example.com/settings/members" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0d5a61;text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;font-weight:600">Invite teammates</a></td><td class="sml-stack pb-6" valign="top" width="50%" style="padding-bottom:1.5rem"><p class="font-heading text-card-foreground m-0 text-[18px] leading-[24px] sml-dark-1vgvcs2" style="margin:0px;font-family:&quot;Iowan Old Style&quot;, &quot;Palatino Linotype&quot;, Palatino, &quot;Book Antiqua&quot;, Georgia, serif;font-size:18px;line-height:24px;color:#14232a">Learn the basics</p><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-2 mb-2 text-[14px] leading-[22px] sml-dark-1js7ka7" style="margin-top:0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#52646b">A ten-minute tour of the parts you will use every day, with examples you can copy.</p><a class="sml-link text-[14px] font-semibold sml-dark-13arv6u" href="https://docs.example.com/start" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#0d5a61;text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;font-weight:600">Read the guide</a></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bg-accent text-accent-foreground rounded-md px-5 py-4 sml-dark-2x4ydk" style="border-radius:4px;background-color:#e0efec;padding-left:1.25rem;padding-right:1.25rem;padding-top:1rem;padding-bottom:1rem;color:#0b4743"><p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-[22px] font-semibold" style="margin:0px;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600">Stuck on something?</p><p class="mt-1 mb-0 text-[14px] leading-[22px]" style="margin-top:0.25rem;margin-bottom:0px;font-size:14px;line-height:22px">Reply to this email. It reaches a person on our team, usually within a working day.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="560" style="width:100%;max-width:560px"><tbody><tr><td class="px-1 pt-6 pb-10" style="padding-left:0.25rem;padding-right:0.25rem;padding-top:1.5rem;padding-bottom:2.5rem"><p class="text-muted-foreground m-0 text-[13px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1js7ka7" style="margin:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#52646b">You are receiving this because you created the Northwind workspace.</p><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-3 mb-0 text-[13px] leading-[20px] sml-dark-1js7ka7" style="margin-top:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0px;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#52646b">Acme, 100 Example Street, Springfield</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>